[h1]Cosmic Ascendancy[/h1]
[i]The definitive endgame crisis, megastructure, and god-tier progression expansion for the Cosmic Series.[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]⚠️ CRITICAL: NEW SAVE FILE HARD REQUIRED ⚠️[/h2]
[b]The massive [THE ASCENSION ERA] update has completely overhauled the internal architecture of the Cosmic Series.[/b]
Attempting to load an existing save will cause severe corruption and crashes due to the massive structural changes. You [b]MUST[/b] start a new galaxy to play!

[hr][/hr]

[h2]🚀 The Ultimate Endgame Experience[/h2]
[b]Cosmic Ascendancy[/b] is the culminating masterpiece of the Cosmic Series. When the Xsotan Wormhole Guardian falls, the galaxy doesn't find peace—it awakens an ancient, ravenous threat: [b]The Eclipse[/b].
Construct massive megastructures, forge god-tier weaponry, and defend the galaxy from apocalyptic World-Eaters in the most ambitious endgame crisis ever brought to Avorion!

[b]⚠️ REQUIRED DEPENDENCY:[/b] Cosmic Ascendancy is the capstone of the ecosystem and part of the "Core 5" mods. It requires all 4 other core Cosmic mods to function. You [b]must[/b] be subscribed to all [b]REQUIRED ITEMS[/b] to play!

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Core Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]🔥 [b]The Eclipse Crisis:[/b] A terrifying new endgame faction of geometric nightmares. Defeating the Wormhole Guardian awakens them to actively conquer the Galaxy Map, deploy Lockdown Citadels, and launch devastating crusades.
[*]☠️ [b]The World-Eater Boss Raid:[/b] Face off against a colossal 5.9km Juggernaut! Survive its 6-Phase Gauntlet featuring Quantum EMPs, Gravity Anomalies, Dark Matter Blinks, Anchor Pylons, and Singularity Implosions!
[*]🏛️ [b]The Ascendancy Beacon Megastructure:[/b] Construct a permanent checkpoint in your capital that natively keeps the sector loaded 24/7! Upgrade it to Tier 5 to grant permanent, account-wide stat multipliers (Hull, Shields, Damage) across your entire fleet.
[*]⚔️ [b]The Stellar Forge:[/b] Extract [i]Ascendant Matter[/i] from dead titans to forge custom God-Tier weapons and Titan-Class Coaxial Lasers over 24 real-time hours. Forging near the Core during active wars yields up to 9.0x super-weapons! Utilize the [i]Ascendant Scrap[/i] system to guarantee crafts.
[*]🛡️ [b]Living Relics & Neural Implants:[/b] Equip Ascendant subsystems that dynamically multiply their power (up to 7.5x) based on Core Proximity and War Heat. Wire your captain directly into the hull with Neural Implants for god-tier flight and squadron stats.
[*]📖 [b]Epic Story Campaign:[/b] Embark on a 3-part narrative campaign to uncover the origins of The Eclipse, unlock the Ascendancy Forge, and claim [i]The Eclipse Bane[/i] artifact.
[*]💰 [b]The Grand Toll & Economics:[/b] AI Factions jumping into your Ascendant Capital pay an entry tax (+50% premium from warring factions!), granting massive treasury payouts every 45 minutes. Feed factories Ascendant Matter to activate 3.0x 'Ascendant Overdrive'!
[*]🚨 [b]Capital Sieges & Citadel Blockades:[/b] Defend your Beacon every 3 to 6 hours from massive invasion fleets to protect your global buffs. Attack Eclipse Citadels that physically trap players in the sector with hyperspace suppression fields!
[*]🗺️ [b]Faction AI 4X Style Expansion & Fallen Empires:[/b] AI Factions and Pirates organically expand their borders and claim uncharted sectors. If The Eclipse annihilates 10 sectors, they trigger a 'Fallen Empire' state to systematically wipe out AI Faction Capitals!
[*]🌑 [b]The Dark Sector & Rift Hazards:[/b] Uncharted sectors near the Galactic Core carry a 20% risk of dropping you into permanent Dark Matter Fog fields crawling with Eclipse Juggernauts and Rift Spillage hazards.
[*]📰 [b]Galactic Dread News:[/b] Server-wide breaking news broadcasts whenever The Eclipse annihilates a sector or players secure a Heroic Victory against an Obliterator or World-Eater.
[/list]

